  "solution": "Minimize \\(z=2x+3y\\) with \\(x+2y\\ge 1,\\ x,y\\ge 0\\). \\((\\tfrac12,0)\\) gives \\(x+2y=\\tfrac12<1\\) — infeasible. Feasible: \\((0,\\tfrac12)\\!\\to\\!1.5\\), \\((\\tfrac12,\\tfrac12)\\!\\to\\!2.5\\), \\((1,2)\\!\\to\\!8\\). Minimum at \\((0,\\tfrac12)\\)."
 },
